        "original_id": "1d5b33b3-aad4-5cc7-9938-4f87f789fcd4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kristin Davis, Darren Star, Brooke Shields\n- Products: Melrose Place, Sex and the City, Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids, Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends, Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends - Harvest Time Hop and Fly\n- Companies: HBO\n\nFacts:\n- Kristin Davis, also listed as Kristin Lee Davis, was born on February 23, 1965, and is an American actress.\n- Sex and the City was an American romantic comedy television series created by Darren Star and produced by HBO.\n- Kristin Davis played Brooke Armstrong on the soap opera Melrose Place from 1995 to 1996.\n- Sex and the City originally aired from 1998 to 2004 and had 94 episodes.\n- Kristin Davis played Charlotte York Goldenblatt on HBO's Sex and the City from 1998 to 2004.\n- Miss Spider first appeared in cartoon format in the movie Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids, with Brooke Shields providing the voice of Miss Spider.\n- Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids spun off the series Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends, with Kristin Davis providing the voice of Miss Spider.\n- Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids also spun off the video game Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends - Harvest Time Hop and Fly.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
